      "filename": "During the Armory era, the former hydroelectric plant was known as the Rolling Mill. After that, it was the Harpers Ferry Paper (87f69189-1dd8-b71b-0b62-daf002607bd0).jpg",
      "title": "File:During the Armory era, the former hydroelectric plant was known as the Rolling Mill. After that, it was the Harpers Ferry Paper (87f69189-1dd8-b71b-0b62-daf002607bd0).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/During_the_Armory_era%2C_the_former_hydroelectric_plant_was_known_as_the_Rolling_Mill._After_that%2C_it_was_the_Harpers_Ferry_Paper_%2887f69189-1dd8-b71b-0b62-daf002607bd0%29.jpg",
