      "title": "File:Company House, House Twelve Group (8bf6c5e8-1dd8-b71b-0bab-dfce62c2c615).JPG",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/Company_House%2C_House_Twelve_Group_%288bf6c5e8-1dd8-b71b-0bab-dfce62c2c615%29.JPG",
